Generic NPN nominal calibration by clamped collector voltage: {run_id}
* Calibration only: TEMP=25 C, collector voltage=target_R*50 uA.
* Find a base bias at which the actual collector port draws 50 uA.
Vtest port 0 DC {voltage_v:.16g}
Vcollector port collector DC 0
Q1 collector base emitter GENERIC_NPN
Vemitter emitter 0 DC 0
Rbias supply base 10k
Vbias supply 0 DC {bias_v:.16g}
{model}
.temp 25
.options tnom=25 reltol=1e-7 abstol=1e-13 vntol=1e-10 gmin={gmin_s:.16g}
.control
set noaskquit
set filetype=ascii
set numdgt=15
op
write op.raw v(port) v(base) i(vcollector) i(vbias)
quit
.endc
.end
